SjZOWFNKc2c?oc=5","date":"2026-11-17","zh":"第二季業績將於收盤後公佈；隔天早上凱西打來。"},{"title":"Casey's General Stores Has Had A Great Run, But The Upside Is Limited (Rating Downgrade)","src":"Seeking Alpha","url":"https://news.google.com/rss/articles/CBMitAFBVV95cUxNWlRFSUp2QlVCbEZycVNHaGlYSzIxWEZsaUV5dkpfdlRQTE0yZnBYV0JSd3JHQWNzYXZYTldyWFhQem13UnNDRVhKQnhhWWVUQ3gyV0ozbE9vN3pscFVRUFZyWkE5LV9IbVpvRWpERVl3QUM1UnRwQ05raUJGdDA2VkV5bFdKT2hhdDRIeVc4WFlqa3B4YkxONDQ1MUtNR1JWNVpIRGd5OXRiYjBzZy14ZzFIbDg?oc=5","date":"2026-11-12","zh":"凱西雜貨店業績出色，但上漲空間有限（評級下調）"},{"title":"Wells Fargo Maintains Caseys General Stores(CASY.US) With Buy Rating, Maintains Target Price $750","src":"Moomoo","url":"https://news.google.com/rss/articles/CBMirwFBVV95cUxNRG5ldHlGSlhFMlNrYVNpZEU1Wm9qT3BzLUU4QVNhSHJXNGVwOHBZMkFCOFctREpFeTdRYVRTYWFvYkdPY3pVbXBJdUtoMVN1UnFGd3FBZURTWjVGRWg5RDg0di1iQm5sMkNyUlFmaUdpd0Jua3dkUXh6Q2c1SWdrZkt6SGNSamJmRXB5dURqZF9ieHI0MHA5V3RSeEVXMUtMei11cC1IOUw0SUlKQ3hZ?oc=5","date":"2026-11-11","zh":"富國銀行維持 Caseys General Stores(CASY.US) 買入評級，維持目標價 750 美元"}],"themes":[{"name":"財報","count":4},{"name":"分析師評等","count":3},{"name":"併購","count":2}],"biz":{"tenk":{"form":"10-K","date":"2026-06-22","period":"2026-04-30","url":"https://www.sec.gov/Archives/edgar/data/726958/000072695826000046/casy-20260430.htm"},"overview":[{"en":"As of April 30, 2026, Casey's General Stores, Inc. and its direct and indirect wholly-owned subsidiaries operate convenience stores primarily under the names \"Casey's\" and \"Casey's General Store\" (collectively, with the stores below referenced as \"GoodStop (by Casey's)\" or \"CEFCO\", referred to as \"Casey's\" or the \"Company\") throughout 19 states, approximately half of which are located in Iowa, Missouri and Illinois.","zh":"截至 2026 年 4 月 30 日，Casey's General Stores, Inc. 及其直接和間接全資子公司主要以“Casey's”和“Casey's General Store”名稱（以下統稱為“GoodStop（Casey's）”或“CEFCO”，簡稱“Casey's”或“公司”）在 19 個州內經營過伊利諾伊州。"},{"en":"As of April 30, 2026, there were 2,944 stores in operation. Approximately 71% of all stores were opened in areas with populations of fewer than 20,000 persons. The Company competes on the basis of traditional features of convenience store operations such as location, extended hours, product offerings, price and quality of service.","zh":"截至2026年4月30日，共有2,944家門市在營運。大約 71% 的商店開設在人口不到 20,000 人的地區。該公司根據便利商店營運的傳統特徵（例如地點、延長營業時間、產品供應、價格和服務品質）進行競爭。"},{"en":"All stores carry a broad selection of food items (which at most stores includes, but is not limited to, prepared foods such as regular and breakfast pizza, donuts, hot breakfast items, and hot and cold sandwiches), beverages, tobacco and nicotine products, groceries, health and beauty aids, automotive products, and other non-food items. As of April 30, 2026, 241 store locations offered car washes. In addition, all but six store locations offer fuel.","zh":"所有商店均出售多種食品（大多數商店包括但不限於預製食品，例如普通披薩和早餐披薩、甜甜圈、熱早餐食品以及冷熱三明治）、飲料、菸草和尼古丁產品、雜貨、健康和美容輔助品、汽車產品和其他非食品商品。截至 2026 年 4 月 30 日，已有 241 家店提供洗車服務。此外，除六家商店外，所有商店都提供燃料。"}],"markets":[],"customers":[],"competition":[{"en":"Our business is highly competitive. Food, including prepared foods, and non-food items similar or identical to those sold by the Company, are generally available from various competitors in the communities served by Casey's and by certain online retailers. We believe our stores located in smaller towns compete principally with other local grocery and convenience stores, similar retail outlets, including \"dollar\" stores, and, to a lesser extent, prepared food outlets, restaurants, and expanded fuel stations offering a more limited selection of grocery and food items for sale. Stores located in more heavily populated communities may compete with local and national grocery and drug store chains, quick service restaurants, expanded fuel stations, supermarkets, discount food stores, and traditional convenience stores.","zh":"我們的業務競爭非常激烈。與公司銷售的食品（包括預製食品）和非食品類似或相同的食品通常可從 Casey's 服務的社區中的各個競爭對手和某些線上零售商處購買。我們認為，我們位於小城鎮的商店主要與其他當地雜貨店和便利商店、類似零售店（包括「一元」商店）競爭，並且在較小程度上與預製食品店、餐廳和擴大的加油站競爭，提供更有限的雜貨和食品選擇。位於人口稠密社區的商店可能會與當地和全國雜貨店和藥局連鎖店、快餐店、擴建的加油站、超市、折扣食品店和傳統便利商店競爭。"},{"en":"In addition to our inside store products, the fuel business is also highly competitive. The Company competes on the basis of price, location, and convenience of our fuel products. Similar to inside, stores compete with larger store chains with expanded fuel offerings and increased buying power in more heavily populated communities.","zh":"除了我們的店內產品外，燃料業務的競爭也非常激烈。該公司的競爭基礎是燃料產品的價格、地點和便利性。與內部類似，商店與大型連鎖店競爭，在人口稠密的社區提供更多的燃料並增加購買力。"}],"segments":{},"peers":["TXRH","MUSA","CBRL","TSCO","CTAS"]}}